Small Pfile that checks to see if the user calling has a birthday. if so
their WHO banner will be saved, Changed to "Its my Birthday today!!" 
and will be greeted by a Happy Birthday Screen.  When the user calls back
and it is no longer their birthday.. It will restore the ORIGINAL WHO
banner the user had and remove it from the Hard Drive.
